<!-- COURSE INTRODUCTION -->
<section class="jee-section" id="course-details">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="jee-section-heading text-center">
            <span class="jee-kicker">UNDERSTAND THE JOURNEY</span>
            <h2>What Is the JEE Preparation Course?</h2>

            <p>
                Joint Entrance Examination (JEE) is an important engineering
                entrance examination in India. JEE Main is used for admissions
                to participating engineering institutions and is also the
                qualifying examination route for JEE Advanced, subject to
                the applicable eligibility rules.
            </p>

            <p>
                This preparation programme focuses on developing the subject
                knowledge, analytical thinking and problem-solving skills
                students need for engineering entrance examinations.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 mt-3">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="jee-info-panel jee-main-panel">
                    <div class="jee-panel-icon">01</div>

                    <span class="jee-panel-label">STEP ONE</span>
                    <h3>JEE Main Preparation</h3>

                    <p>
                        Build a strong understanding of the prescribed syllabus,
                        practise different question types and develop speed
                        and accuracy for the computer-based examination.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="jee-feature-list">
                        <li>Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics</li>
                        <li>Concept-based question practice</li>
                        <li>Revision and mock-test practice</li>
                        <li>Preparation for participating institutions</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/"
                       target="_blank"
                       rel="noopener noreferrer"
                       class="jee-text-link">
                        Official JEE Main website ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="jee-info-panel jee-advanced-panel">
                    <div class="jee-panel-icon">02</div>

                    <span class="jee-panel-label">NEXT LEVEL</span>
                    <h3>JEE Advanced Preparation</h3>

                    <p>
                        For eligible candidates targeting IIT admissions,
                        preparation can include deeper conceptual understanding,
                        multi-step problems and application of concepts
                        in unfamiliar situations.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="jee-feature-list">
                        <li>Advanced problem-solving practice</li>
                        <li>Strong subject fundamentals</li>
                        <li>Analytical and logical reasoning</li>
                        <li>Preparation based on the official syllabus</li>
                    </ul>

                    <a href="https://jeeadv.ac.in/"
                       target="_blank"
                       rel="noopener noreferrer"
                       class="jee-text-link">
                        Official JEE Advanced website ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

