<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="jee-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="jee-section-heading text-center">
            <span class="jee-kicker">HAVE QUESTIONS?</span>
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p>
                Some common questions students ask before starting
                their JEE preparation.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion jee-faq mt-4" id="jeeFaq">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#jeeFaqOne"
                            aria-expanded="true"
                            aria-controls="jeeFaqOne">
                        What is the difference between JEE Main and JEE Advanced?
                    </button>
                </h3>

                <div id="jeeFaqOne"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                     data-bs-parent="#jeeFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        JEE Main is used for admissions to participating
                        institutions such as NITs and IIITs and forms part
                        of the qualifying route for JEE Advanced. JEE Advanced
                        is the entrance examination for IIT admissions,
                        subject to the applicable rules.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#jeeFaqTwo"
                            aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="jeeFaqTwo">
                        When should students start preparing for JEE?
                    </button>
                </h3>

                <div id="jeeFaqTwo"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#jeeFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Many students start building their preparation
                        during Class 11. The appropriate plan depends
                        on the student's current understanding, goals
                        and available study time.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#jeeFaqThree"
                            aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="jeeFaqThree">
                        Which subjects should I study for JEE B.E./B.Tech.?
                    </button>
                </h3>

                <div id="jeeFaqThree"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#jeeFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics are the core
                        subjects for JEE Main Paper 1 (B.E./B.Tech.).
                        Refer to the official syllabus for the applicable year.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#jeeFaqFour"
                            aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="jeeFaqFour">
                        How can I improve my JEE preparation?
                    </button>
                </h3>

                <div id="jeeFaqFour"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#jeeFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Focus on understanding concepts, practising questions,
                        revising regularly, analysing mistakes and attempting
                        appropriate mock tests. Use a realistic timetable
                        and track your progress.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                            type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#jeeFaqFive"
                            aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="jeeFaqFive">
                        Where can I check the official syllabus?
                    </button>
                </h3>

                <div id="jeeFaqFive"
                     class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                     data-bs-parent="#jeeFaq">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Check the current syllabus and examination information
                        on the official
                        <a href="https://jeemain.nta.nic.in/"
                           target="_blank"
                           rel="noopener noreferrer">JEE Main website</a>
                        and
                        <a href="https://jeeadv.ac.in/"
                           target="_blank"
                           rel="noopener noreferrer">JEE Advanced website</a>.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

